1736:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TIM commutation event sequence.
1737:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @note  This function is mandatory to use the commutation event in order to
1738:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        update the configuration at each commutation detection on the TRGI input of the Timer,
1739:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        the typical use of this feature is with the use of another Timer(interface Timer)
1740:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        configured in Hall sensor interface, this interface Timer will generate the
1741:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        commutation at its TRGO output (connected to Timer used in this function) each time
1742:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        the TI1 of the Interface Timer detect a commutation at its input TI1.
